*.pyc

# Runtime cursor, written by iteration.py whenever it creates a folder, so
# the write guards can scope by iteration. Transient coordination state, not
# an artifact of a run — it changes on every pipeline step.
docs/.current_iteration

# Mechanical record of hook decisions (see scripts/hook_audit.py). Runtime
# evidence for the live-fire test, not an artifact of a run.
docs/hook-audit.log

# pytest cache
.pytest_cache/
